      "field": "Normalized value",
      "reason": "Eryone's Silk PLA publishes 1.7 % beside a strength of 55.2 MPa and a modulus of 1215.4 MPa. Taken together the elongation is below the strain those two imply, which is the maker's own arithmetic on one sheet; each number is recorded as the sheet prints it and none is inferred from the others.",
